 privatiser le voilier en entier. Choisissez l’heure de départ. Participez à la navigation si vous en avez envie. Partez en exploration !","photo":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f1/Chateau_Versailles_Galerie_des_Glaces.jpg/960px-Chateau_Versailles_Galerie_des_Glaces.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","photoCredit":"Illustration · Myrabella, CC BY-SA 3.0","photoGeneric":true},{"id":"dt-place-2ec46661-fb4b-362f-98b0-95bc74442e4b","isPlace":true,"scene":"village","city":"larochelle","category":"À voir","title":"Eglise Saint Etienne","date":null,"time":"","place":"32 place de la République, Aigrefeuille-d'Aunis","lat":46.117454,"lng":-0.93326,"price":"Voir sur place","thumb":"","source":"datatourisme","createdAt":1791168335537,"description":"L'église Saint Etienne d'Aigrefeuille d'Aunis connut différentes périodes de construction.\r\nSes murs ont conservé des vestiges des XIIème au XVIIème siècle. L'art roman est présent dans cet édifice par son transept à voûtes en berceau brisé.","photo":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2d/Abbaye_Fontenay_eglise_facade.jpg/960px-Abbaye_Fontenay_eglise_facade.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","photoCredit":"Illustration · Myrabella, CC BY-SA 4.0","photoGeneric":true},{"id":"dt-place-aa6a7331-fa49-3b9b-9039-b99e4eb954a9","isPlace":true,"scene":"village","city":"larochelle","category":"À voir","title":"Sortie demi-journée Fort Boyard  en catamaran - ​Catamaran La Rochelle","date":null,"time":"","place":"Port des Minimes Ponton 56 Quai Marillac Digue du Bout Blanc Ponton 56, La Rochelle","lat":46.148458,"lng":-1.162877,"price":"Voir sur place","thumb":"","source":"datatourisme","createdAt":1791168335537,"description":"Découvrez Fort Boyard et faites le tour de L'Ile d'Aix.\r\nLe nombre de passagers est volontairement limité à 14 pers pour un confort maximum ( nous pouvons accueillir des groupes jusque 20 pers en privatisation)","photo":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e2/Chateau_Luynes.jpg/960px-Chateau_Luynes.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","photoCredit":"Illustration · Myrabella, CC BY-SA 3.0","photoGeneric":true},{"id":"dt-place-6b7901fc-2851-3f71-aff0-a990f6f07d17","isPlace":true,"scene":"expo","city":"larochelle","category":"À voir","title":"Musée Napoléon","date":null,"time":"","place":"30 rue Napoléon, Île-d'Aix","lat":46.01281,"lng":-1.174812,"price":"Voir sur place","thumb":"","source":"datatourisme","createdAt":1791168335537,"description":"Aujourd'hui monument historique, c'est la maison dans laquelle Napoléon se rendit aux Anglais.","photo":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/20/Museum_of_the_History_of_Polish_Jews_in_Warsaw_Main_exhibition_Gwo%C5%BAdziec_synagogue.jpg/960px-Museum_of_the_History_of_Polish_Jews_in_Warsaw_Main_exhibition_Gwo%C5%BAdziec_synagogue.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","photoCredit":"Illustration · Magdalena Starowieyska, Dariusz Golik, CC BY-SA 3.0 pl","photoGeneric":true},{"id":"dt-place-9435522d-826a-3478-89c4-149c0eb13b64","isPlace":true,"scene":"expo","city":"larochelle","category":"À voir","title":"Musée Africain","date":null,"time":"","place":"rue Napoléon, Île-d'Aix","lat":46.012546,"lng":-1.174544,"price":"Voir sur place","thumb":"","source":"datatourisme","createdAt":1791168335537,"description":"L' Afrique à l'île d'Aix.","photo":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/Mus%C3%A9e_africain-Ile_d%27Aix2.JPG/960px-Mus%C3%A9e_africain-Ile_d%27Aix2.JPG?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","photoCredit":"Wikimedia Commons"},{"id":"dt-place-58421a30-7867-31ed-8d31-73e0d2d839c4","isPlace":true,"scene":"expo","city":"larochelle","category":"À voir","title":"Musée de la Résidence des Indes","date":null,"time":"","place":"74 chemin du re